{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471858",
      "title": "Animating with CSS Transitions",
      "sourceHash": "33ea7471d7fc0f774e34e6d7941b389a14971522840b4b58e3d8db77763e5824",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 2.53,
          "en": "Now, as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.53,
          "end": 5.4,
          "en": "we'll actually not start by diving into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.4,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "Framer Motion right away, even though we'll spend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 12.15,
          "en": "the majority of this section with that package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "But we will actually start with just CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "because you might not need an animation library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "like Framer Motion, instead CSS Transitions and Animations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "features that are built right into vanilla CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 31.11,
          "en": "might be enough for some use cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.11,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "And therefore you don't necessarily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "need to install and learn a new library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 38.343,
          "en": "just to animate some things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.21,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "For example here in this demo app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "let's take a look at this view details button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "When I press it, this expands,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "and I can view some details here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 54.753,
          "en": "but you might notice that this icon here never changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.83,
          "end": 58.5,
          "en": "And it would be nice if this would basically just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.5,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "rotate and point down if the details are expanded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "and point up if they're not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "And as it turns out this is something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "you can animate with just CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.42,
          "en": "To do that, let's go to that project folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.42,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "and then there you'll find an index CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.96000000000001,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "which is rather large",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 83.13,
          "en": "because it contains all the styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "for this entire project here, for this entire website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "just to have one single CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 93.093,
          "en": "and not have a bunch of CSS files flying around here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.93,
          "end": 98.93,
          "en": "And in that file, we can find this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 102.483,
          "en": "or some style that allows us to target that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 108.56,
          "en": "And to now add some CSS code here to animate this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.72,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "let's first go to the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "that's responsible for this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 118.59,
          "en": "and this code can be found here in the components folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.59,
          "end": 122.437,
          "en": "in the ChallengeItem.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.437,
          "end": 127.14,
          "en": ".jsx as a file extension here because this is Vite project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 127.14,
          "end": 131.973,
          "en": "where you need to add .jsx instead of just .js at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 137.16,
          "en": "And then in this file here, you got the view details text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 137.16,
          "end": 139.17000000000002,
          "en": "and then here this is the icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 139.17000000000002,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "So this entire span here is the icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 144.333,
          "en": "that should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "And as you see, this icon has a CSS className",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "and we can just copy that className",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 156.543,
          "en": "and then search for that className here in this CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "And once we found it, we can animate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.38,
          "end": 164.28,
          "en": "because as you can see, there are two CSS rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.28,
          "end": 167.64,
          "en": "that seem to involve this icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.64,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "And even if you don't know CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "which you absolutely don't have to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 176.25,
          "en": "for this section, you should be able to find these two rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 178.2,
          "en": "and you will be able to follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.2,
          "end": 180.363,
          "en": "with the changes we're about to make.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.62,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "Because now that we identified these two rules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 187.47,
          "en": "we can add some animations here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.47,
          "end": 190.38,
          "en": "And indeed, as you can see there already is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.38,
          "end": 195.38,
          "en": "the transform CSS property being set to this rotate value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 198.75,
          "en": "so it looks like we're already trying to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 198.75,
          "end": 202.623,
          "en": "at least rotate the icon, even if it's not animated yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.79,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "But for this to be activated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 209.61,
          "en": "we must make sure that the expanded CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.61,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "is added to some element above this icon element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 216.453,
          "en": "that has a class of challenge-item-details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 222.39,
          "en": "So let's go back to the ChallengeItem.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.39,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "and there it's this challenge-item-details div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 230.103,
          "en": "that needs this expanded class for this icon to be rotated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.21,
          "end": 234.99,
          "en": "So we wanna conditionally add this expanded class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.99,
          "end": 237.24,
          "en": "if the details are visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.24,
          "end": 240.06,
          "en": "and as you can see here in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.06,
          "end": 245.06,
          "en": "there is isExpanded prop which we're receiving,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.37,
          "end": 248.1,
          "en": "which then tells us whether this item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.1,
          "end": 250.17,
          "en": "is currently expanded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.17,
          "end": 253.203,
          "en": "whether the details of this item are expanded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.22,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "So with that, we can just go here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "and actually replace this className here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 259.92,
          "end": 262.29,
          "en": "with a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 264.99,
          "en": "where we can use the template literal syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.99,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "with two backticks to construct a string with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 271.83,
          "en": "because it's this backtick syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 271.83,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "that then makes it easy for us to inject dynamic values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.19,
          "en": "into this string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.19,
          "end": 281.37,
          "en": "And here I want to inject a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.37,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "depending on whether is expanded is true or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 289.38,
          "en": "If it's true, I want to add the expanded class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 289.38,
          "end": 291.633,
          "en": "to this list of classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.59000000000003,
          "end": 294.51,
          "en": "Otherwise I'll add an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.51,
          "end": 297.543,
          "en": "so I will not add any extra classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 298.68,
          "end": 300.78,
          "en": "This is one way of dynamically adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.78,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "a class to a class list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 306.06,
          "en": "And with that change made, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 306.06,
          "end": 308.973,
          "en": "we can now at least see that this button rotates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 310.14,
          "end": 312.27,
          "en": "But of course it's not animated yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 312.27,
          "end": 314.88,
          "en": "and that's the next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 319.17,
          "en": "because animating this button now means that we need to tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 319.17,
          "end": 324.17,
          "en": "CSS that this change to this rotation should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.11,
          "end": 326.55,
          "en": "And this can be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 326.55,
          "end": 330.75,
          "en": "with help of a feature called CSS Transitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 330.75,
          "end": 334.8,
          "en": "CSS Transitions can be used by adding the transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.8,
          "end": 336.45,
          "en": "property to a rule",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 336.45,
          "end": 338.28,
          "en": "and here it's to the base rule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 338.28,
          "end": 340.53,
          "en": "which is always active on this icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 340.53,
          "end": 343.38,
          "en": "so not the rule that's just active if the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 343.38,
          "end": 344.85,
          "en": "parent is expanded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 344.85,
          "end": 347.253,
          "en": "but instead the rule that's always active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 348.57,
          "end": 351.12,
          "en": "And here we can tell CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 351.12,
          "end": 356.12,
          "en": "for which future changes to which CSS properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 356.46,
          "end": 358.773,
          "en": "we want to animate those changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 359.94,
          "end": 361.89,
          "en": "And here in this example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 361.89,
          "end": 365.04,
          "en": "where we want to animate this transformation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 365.04,
          "end": 368.34,
          "en": "we could tell CSS that we wanna animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 368.34,
          "end": 372.78,
          "en": "all transitions for the transform property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 372.78,
          "end": 375.12,
          "en": "So whenever that property changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 375.12,
          "end": 378.42,
          "en": "for example from no value to this value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 378.42,
          "end": 381.03,
          "en": "we wanna animate that change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 381.03,
          "end": 384.81,
          "en": "we want to have CSS animate that change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 384.81,
          "end": 386.31,
          "en": "that's what we're saying here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 387.39,
          "end": 388.8,
          "en": "You could also say all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 388.8,
          "end": 391.62,
          "en": "if you want to animate all CSS properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 391.62,
          "end": 393.87,
          "en": "that could change on this element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 393.87,
          "end": 396.513,
          "en": "but here it's just a transform property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 398.07,
          "end": 400.47,
          "en": "Next, you can set a duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 400.47,
          "end": 402.78,
          "en": "over which the animation should be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 402.78,
          "end": 405.33299999999997,
          "en": "For example, 0.3 seconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 406.29,
          "end": 409.2,
          "en": "you could also write this as 300 milliseconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 409.2,
          "end": 410.37,
          "en": "and it's of course up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 410.37,
          "end": 412.233,
          "en": "which duration you wanna pick here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 413.22,
          "end": 415.74,
          "en": "And then you can also add a easing function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 415.74,
          "end": 419.25,
          "en": "which basically controls the acceleration of the animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 419.25,
          "end": 421.35,
          "en": "and therefore the look and feel of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 421.35,
          "end": 424.65,
          "en": "For example here, we could use ease out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.65,
          "end": 428.43,
          "en": "or ease in or any other easing function value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 428.43,
          "end": 430.413,
          "en": "here I'll go for ease out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 431.67,
          "end": 434.34,
          "en": "And with that added, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 434.34,
          "end": 439.32,
          "en": "you will see that now this arrow here is animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 439.32,
          "end": 442.77,
          "en": "even though we have not added any extra library,",
          "zh": ""
